Universal Bone Meal for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of Universal Bone Meal 26.3.1 by Fuzs.
Original source: https://github.com/Fuzss/universal-bone-meal
Original licence: MPL-2.0

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko, after an earlier port by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in
Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included). The data files in data/ (the
fertilizer_resistant_plants tag, the spore blossom loot table and the five coral placed features)
are the original's, under its MPL-2.0. This port is distributed under the same licence as the
original (MPL-2.0); the licence text is in LICENSE.

The original's assets licence (LICENSE-ASSETS.md, All Rights Reserved) doesn't apply: this package
carries no assets from it. The icon is new, made for this port.
